 mean='One who has studied even a little of the Bhagavad Gītā, drunk even a drop of Gaṅgā water, worshipped Murāri even once: with him, Yama, the lord of death, has no quarrel.',
 plain='Read a little of the Gītā, take a drop of Gaṅgā water, worship Kṛṣṇa even once with love, and death holds no terror for you.',
